<title>USA: Wiser Oil to buy some oil, gas assets.</title>
<headline>Wiser Oil to buy some oil, gas assets.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wiser Oil Co said it had entered into a letter of intent to acquire certain oil and gas producing assets and undeveloped leases in South Texas from a privately held firm for total $15.2 million.</p>
<p>The closing is expected no later than June, it said.</p>
<p>Wiser did not name the company from which it was making the acquisition.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
